 "raw_output": "Coca-Cola's operating income rose about 26.5% from fiscal Q1 2024 to fiscal Q4 2024.\n\n- **Q1 2024 operating income:** $2,141 million, from the Q1 2025 10-Q comparative column.\n- **Q4 2024 operating income:** this is not reported directly, so I derived it as full-year 2024 less the first nine months of 2024. That is $9,992 million \u2212 $7,283 million = $2,709 million.\n- **Change:** ($2,709 \u2212 $2,141) / $2,141 = $568 / $2,141 \u2248 26.5%.\n\n{\"value\": 26.5, \"unit\": \"percent\", \"choice\": null, \"status\": \"answered\"}",
